<!-- Adaptive-icon background for the Autumn alias: sky, sun, hill, ground and road, in that
     theme's own colours. Nothing here is invented for the icon: SceneTheme.AUTUMN.skyDay for the
     sky ramp, the scene's green hill (hillColorsDay[0] is what the autumn scene actually draws
     behind the town) and its rust ground.

     Containment: the only drawing that has to stay inside the safe zone is the sun, at 29.79 dp
     from the centre against a safe radius of 33 dp, so 3.21 dp of margin. Everything else in this
     file reaches the edge or lies outside the mask on purpose: sky, hill, ground, asphalt, centre
     line, fallen leaves are background that bleeds under any launcher mask, and clipping them is
     the intended behaviour. -->
